200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mbNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"247f46da-d5f1-40ef-a4d8-e10d2b802563","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こんなこと言ってるけど私もドキュメント後回しにしちゃう","ts":"1629898344.327700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gLU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4cd9780-0296-41fa-9bc1-d6279c4be2bc","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"気持ちはわかる。私もドキュメントは後回しにしちゃうので","ts":"1629898303.327200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q6r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3c0d0f2-8ae8-4875-a4f9-733f0da93fcc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"斬新すぎる","ts":"1629898137.326900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OLV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d697d2b-fdc3-4e69-8503-21c6ac0c2d50","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ、For more information please refer this \u003chttps://github.com/dinhhuy258/git.nvim/blob/main/lua/git.lua|file\u003eとか書いてあるけどhelp書けよって気持ちになるな","ts":"1629897931.326500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Knz0y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f519a47-7fcc-4faa-a044-93b459bbbed3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94\u003e\n名前はさっぱりな感じ","ts":"1629897228.326000","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: ギンピ・ギンピ","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"ギンピ・ギンピ","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94","text":"ギンピ・ギンピ（英語: Gympie gympie、学名：Dendrocnide moroides）は、イラクサ科に属する被子植物。この他にも、ギンピ（英語: Gympie）、スティンギング・ブラッシュ (英語: stinging brush）、ギンピ・スティンガー（英語: Gympie stinger）、マルベリー＝リーヴド・スティンガー（英語: Mulberry-leaved stinger）や、単にスティンガー（英語: Stinger）、ザ・スーサイド・プラント（英語: The suicide plant）、ムーンライター（英語: Moonlighter）とも呼ばれる。オーストラリア北東部の熱帯雨林に自生する。英名に含まれるスティンガー（英語: stinger、「刺すもの」の意）に表されているように、ギンピ・ギンピ全体を刺毛が覆っており、この刺毛に触れたものに人間にも有毒な神経毒を送り込む。ギンピ・ギンピは、オーストラリアに自生するイラノキ属（学名：Dendrocnide）の中で、最も毒性の強い植物である。ただしギンピ・ギンピの果実は、その表面を覆う刺毛の除去さえ行えば食用にすることが可能である。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Stinging_tree.JPG/1200px-Stinging_tree.JPG","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AE%E3%83%B3%E3%83%94"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7="}]},{"client_msg_id":"150d1fde-c726-488b-87e0-dd8792aded6d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そういう名前をつけただけで「これ作った人絶対性格悪いわー」と思われるのでオススメです（？）","ts":"1629896669.325500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hEu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f467ab2-1c9e-4e7a-8681-e438d1a86dcc","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"触るだけでクッソ痛い植物か","ts":"1629896327.324600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vyj9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11e6c757-44d3-4014-bfae-f7bdbb053689","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"知ってる人は知ってるヤバい奴。","ts":"1629896112.324300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Fi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"182d46e3-b6ab-4ce1-90bc-8a8b76212fa4","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"どうせなら「gympie-gympie」という名前にすりゃ良かったのに。","ts":"1629895852.323900","team":"T0